<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Aegis-SOC | AI Analysis</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css" />
</head>
<body data-page="ai-analysis">
  <div class="page-loader" id="page-loader"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved fa-spin"></i></div>

  <div class="app-container" id="app">
    <div id="sidebar-slot"></div>

    <div class="main-area">
      <div class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-title" id="page-title"></div>
        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <i class="fas fa-expand" onclick="document.documentElement.requestFullscreen()"></i>
          <i class="fas fa-circle-question"></i>
          <div class="notif-badge"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i></div>
          <div class="avatar" id="user-avatar">A</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="grid-2" style="height: calc(100vh - 150px)">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 15px">
              <i class="fas fa-brain blue"></i> Explainable AI (XAI) Report
            </h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 5px"><strong>Classification:</strong> SSH Brute Force</p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 15px"><strong>Model Confidence:</strong> <span class="red">98.4%</span></p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 10px"><strong>Why did the model decide this?</strong></p>
            <ul style="margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height: 1.6">
              <li>High frequency of connection attempts (45 in 10 seconds).</li>
              <li>Multiple failed authentication payloads observed.</li>
              <li>Anomalous source IP behavior compared to baseline.</li>
              <li>Entropy of source ports indicates automated tooling (e.g., Hydra).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom: 20px">Feature Importance (Random Forest)</h3>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px">
              <div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px">
                  <span>Packet Frequency</span><span>0.89</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #333; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px">
                  <div style="background: var(--red); width: 89%; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px">
                  <span>Failed Logins</span><span>0.75</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #333; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px">
                  <div style="background: var(--yellow); width: 75%; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px">
                  <span>Dst Port Variance</span><span>0.40</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #333; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px">
                  <div style="background: var(--accent); width: 40%; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 5px">
                  <span>Payload Length</span><span>0.15</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background: #333; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px">
                  <div style="background: var(--purple); width: 15%; height: 100%; border-radius: 4px"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.0/firebase-database-compat.js"></script>
  <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.0/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
  <script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.0/firebase-auth-compat.js"></script>
  <script src="js/firebase-config.js"></script>
  <script src="js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>